    algorithm: ["Record the last index at which each letter appears.","Sweep the string with a running partition [start, end], both starting at 0.","At each position, stretch end to the furthest last-occurrence of the current letter.","When the scan index reaches end, every letter in the part is fully contained.","Record the part length and move start just past it."],
    fixes: ["Extend end to the LAST occurrence of the current letter, not just the current index.","Close the part only when the scan index equals end."],
