    inputOutput: ["matrix: an m by n grid.","Return its values in clockwise spiral order.","Input: [[1,2,3],[4,5,6],[7,8,9]]\nOutput: [1,2,3,6,9,8,7,4,5]"],
    conceptChoices: ["Peel top → right → bottom → left, shrinking bounds","Rotate the matrix 90° repeatedly, taking the first row","Visit diagonally from each corner"],
    algorithm: ["Set the four boundaries: top, bottom, left, right.","While the boundaries have not crossed, walk the top row left to right, then move top down.","Walk the right column top to bottom, then move right in.","If rows remain, walk the bottom row right to left, then move bottom up.","If columns remain, walk the left column bottom to top, then move left in."],
